DESCRIPTION:This is the last WWC outdoor ecstatic dance of 2026. No experie
 nce necessary. Feel free to bring friends and family members\, since it's 
 Family Weekend at WWC.\n \n\nIntention: The Long Thread\nWe carry more tha
 n we know: stories\, wounds\, wisdom\, love\, habits\, hopes\, and the tra
 ces of those who came before us. On this night\, we’ll honor our ancesto
 rs and the long line that brought us here\, feeling the thread of life mov
 ing through us. And we’ll turn toward the future: what do we want to car
 ry forward\, and what do we want to leave behind?
GEO:35.61223;-82.440756
LOCATION:Morris Pavilion
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance: The Long Thread
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/ecstatic-dance-the-lon
 g-thread
CATEGORIES:Social
END:VEVENT
