DESCRIPTION:Swannatopia Presents: BOOM BOOM BARNS is a free\, all ages\, am
 bient farm stroll and multimedia light show to be held on November 14\, 20
 26 at Warren Wilson College. Organized in collaboration with WWC Art & Cra
 ft Department and The Center for Working Lands\, BOOM BOOM BARNS will acti
 vate 5 acres of beautiful and historic barnscape as stages\, projection su
 rfaces\, and installation spaces. This event will showcase many projects c
 reated by our arts\, music\, and farming community here in the Swannanoa R
 iver Valley and beyond. \n\n \n\nTogether we will look\, listen\, move\, t
 aste\, and feel\, as we participate in a temporal study of the landscape\n
 \n \n\nParking will open at 3pm and the day will kick off with a performan
 ce by the WWC Gamelan orchestra at 4pm\, and live sets by Superflower & an
 d Sally Anne Morgan Quartet\, followed by the premiere of Swannatopia’s 
 The Sweetest Sweet Potato Ballet-  inspired by a true tale of time traveli
 ng tubers!\n\n \n\nThis event is made possible by Warren Wilson College\, 
 ArtsAVL Community Builds Grant and The Windgate Foundation.
GEO:35.613818;-82.438862
LOCATION:Warren Wilson College Farm
SUMMARY:Boom Boom Barns
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/boom-boom-barns
